= entry .Reifier   unpickles the TASTy types in semantic diagnostics back into stenography `Syntax`
-   detail
+   detail

-       A `Reifier(classpath)` holds a compiler context over a hellenism `LocalClasspath`,
-       made lazily on first use, against which the TASTy payload of each `Markup.Typed` node
-       is unpickled into a type and rendered as a stenography `Syntax`. The classpath should
-       be the one the diagnosed code was compiled against — the pickler guarantees a payload
-       resolves against the classpath alone, everything else having been replaced by a
-       `Placeholder`, which `Reifier.substitute` puts back by its printed text.
+       Un `Reifier(classpath)` contiene un contexto del compilador sobre un `LocalClasspath` de
+       hellenism, creado de forma perezosa en el primer uso, contra el que la carga útil TASTy de
+       cada nodo `Markup.Typed` se desempaqueta en un tipo y se representa como un `Syntax` de
+       stenography. El classpath debe ser aquel contra el que se compiló el código diagnosticado:
+       el empaquetador garantiza que una carga útil se resuelve únicamente contra el classpath,
+       porque todo lo demás se ha sustituido por un `Placeholder`, que `Reifier.substitute`
+       vuelve a poner mediante su texto impreso.

=       `Placeholder`, which `Reifier.substitute` puts back by its printed text.
